      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَفْهُومٌ</span></b>  [pass. part. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَهِمَ</span>; <i>Understood,</i> or
<i>known.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And hence, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَفْظٍ مَفْهُومٌ</span> <i>The acceptation
